{
  "format": "qtspice-project",
  "version": 2,
  "netlists": [
    {
      "name": "main",
      "text": "Diode forward sweep, about 1 nA to 10 mA (W5 log Y demo)\n* A 1N4148-like diode swept from 15 mV to 0.695 V. Vm (0 V) measures the diode current\n* I(vm), which spans seven decades: on a linear Y axis everything below 1 mA sits on\n* zero. The saved plot layout shows it on a log Y axis (right-click a pane >\n* Logarithmic Y axis).\nV1 in 0 DC 0\nVm in a DC 0\nD1 a 0 D1N4148\n.model D1N4148 D(IS=2.52n N=1.752 RS=0.568 CJO=4p)\n.dc V1 15m 0.695 1m\n.end\n"
    }
  ],
  "diagrams": [],
  "block_sources": [],
  "analysis": {
    "card": "",
    "diagram_t_end": 1.0,
    "diagram_dt": 0.001
  },
  "results": [],
